@base = http://localhost:8182/api
@token = COLE_TOKEN_AQUI

### Disponibilidade
GET {{base}}/health

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin@contabil.local","password":"SENHA_DO_SEU_ENV"}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fornecedores
GET {{base}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar fornecedor
POST {{base}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Fornecedor Exemplo","city":"Guarapuava","state":"PR"}

### Nota de entrada (ICMS 3,60, IPI 1,50, líquido 24,90)
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"issue_date":"2026-11-12","supplier":"Fornecedor Exemplo","number":"123","city":"Guarapuava","state":"PR","icms_base":"30.00","icms_total":"3.60","ipi_total":"1.50","gross_total":"30.00","net_total":"24.90","items":[{"sku":"ABC123","description":"Produto exemplo","cfop":"1102","quantity":"3","unit_price":"10.00","icms_base":"30.00","icms_rate":"12","ipi_rate":"5"}]}

### Listar notas
GET {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar itens das notas
GET {{base}}/invoice-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notas disponíveis para apuração
GET {{base}}/invoices?pending_only=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar apuração (use o ID retornado da nota)
POST {{base}}/tax-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Entradas Novembro 2026","invoice_ids":[1]}

### Histórico de apurações
GET {{base}}/tax-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
